@host = https://localhost:7217

### District list
GET {{host}}/api/districts
Accept: application/json

### One district with its salespeople and stores
GET {{host}}/api/districts/5
Accept: application/json

### Salespeople (for the "add salesperson" picker)
GET {{host}}/api/salespeople
Accept: application/json

### Add Gustav (7) as a secondary in Zealand (4)
POST {{host}}/api/districts/4/secondaries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salespersonId": 7 }

### Remove him again
DELETE {{host}}/api/districts/4/secondaries/7

### Rejected: Anna (1) is already the primary of North Denmark (1)
POST {{host}}/api/districts/1/secondaries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salespersonId": 1 }

### Make Gustav (7) the primary of Zealand (4); Freja leaves the district
PUT {{host}}/api/districts/4/primary
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salespersonId": 7 }

### Put Freja (6) back as primary
PUT {{host}}/api/districts/4/primary
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salespersonId": 6 }
